<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079113/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079114" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro Illustrissimo, et Celeberrimo
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Jo:</abbr><expan>Johanni</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Mensis ferme excurrit ex quo primas meas ad Te <rs key="B_991170515151705501" type="letter">litte<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ras</rs> dedi, quibus rogab<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ut confestim ad me responde<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re dignaveris, nimir<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> an meam <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dissertationem
      <lb/>de Separatione Fluidor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in Corpore Animali</rs> istuc per
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3173435" type="place">Mediolan<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> ante mens<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> jam transmiss<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>, accepisses. Scrip<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>si ad Te Vir <choice><abbr>Illustriss.</abbr><expan>Illustrissime</expan></choice> duas alias <rs key="B_991170515151605501 B_991170515151505501" type="letter">epistolas</rs> e<choice><orig><g ref="#ohat">ô</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice>dem spec<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tantes. Ne <add>mihi</add> succenseas quaeso si etiam hanc tertiam
      <lb/>epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ad Te mitto, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> etiam atque etiam rogo,
      <lb/>obsecroque ut responsion<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> ad meas litteras<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Bernoulli hatte den Empfang des Pakets bereits im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151405501">Brief</rs> vom 18. Oktober 1719 bestätigt. Michelotti berichtet im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151205501">Brief</rs> vom 3. November, die Antwort sei acht Tage zuvor bei ihm eingetroffen.</note> amplius
      <lb/>non differas. Inquietus enim s<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> et perturbatus timens
      <lb/>ne aut Tu mala fruaris valetudine (quod gravissime
      <lb/>ferrem) aut mea Dissertatio, in qua conscribenda
      <lb/>tant<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> temporis insumpsi, <add>forte</add> perierit. Cras responsio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem <rs key="place_GEO-3173435" type="place">Mediolano</rs> accipi<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ab Illustrissima <rs key="pers_DE-588-1221330748" type="person">Maria Mar<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>chionissa Butintrochi</rs>, atque <add>ex</add> ejus <rs type="letter">litteris</rs> intelligam
      <lb/>quo tempore, et qua die <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basil<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>am</rs> mitti curaverit
      <lb/>et qua ratione fascicul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, de quo toties dixi in ante<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cedentibus meis <rs type="letter">litteris</rs>. Utere, quaeso, omni diligentia
      <lb/>in eod<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> fasciculo perquirendo. Omnes enim sumptus
      <lb/>subito persolv<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> uti de hac re toties locutus sum cum
      <lb/>Celeberrimo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnato</rs> Tuo, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> brevi huc perventur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>existimo. Siquidem dies novem <add>transierunt</add> ex quo
      <lb/>ipse discessit <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavio</rs>. Parce Vir Amicissime si re<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1079115" n="2"/>
      <lb break="no"/>petitis litteris Tibi taedi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> affero: et si quibus in rebus
      <lb/>Tibi inservire poss<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, scito me ita h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c vivere
      <lb/>ut nihil magis aveam quam tuis mandatis parere,
      <lb/>ideoque impera et Vale.</p>
  <closer><dateline>Dab<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1719-10-20">20
      <lb/>Octobris 1719.</date></dateline></closer>
<pb facs="1079116" n="3" type="empty"/>
<pb facs="1079117" n="4"/>
  <closer><address>
      <addrLine>A Monsieur</addrLine>
      <addrLine>Monsieur Jean Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></addrLine>
      <addrLine>Professeur tres celebre de Matematique</addrLine>
      <note type="postal">franca per <rs key="place_GEO-2775220" type="place">Insprug</rs></note>
      <addrLine><choice><orig>a</orig><reg>à</reg></choice> <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basle</rs></addrLine>
